### Useful Regex Cheatsheet for Log Parsing

| Target | Regex Pattern | Example Command |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Specific Blog Posts** (e.g., posts 22-26) | `post=2[2-6]` | `grep -E 'post=2[2-6]' apache-ex2.log` |
| **All .php endpoints** | `\.php` | `grep -E '\.php' apache-ex2.log` |
| **IP Addresses** | `^([0-9]{1,3}\.){3}[0-9]{1,3}` | `grep -E '^([0-9]{1,3}\.){3}[0-9]{1,3}' apache-ex2.log` |
| **Email Domains** | `@[a-zA-Z0-9.-]+\.[a-zA-Z]{2,}` | `grep -E '@[a-zA-Z0-9.-]+\.[a-zA-Z]{2,}' emails.log` |
